{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"inside","top":{"$ref":"01M6S74NN6Z2M6HGRZD1GSHTJA"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NN6Z2M6HGRZD1GSHTJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN7SHFYW6AR23W65XAF"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN8BTCFGAPXA7HVG684"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN98C8V9HJDVBY01X0A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNAYYJFXJKX3QYQHERH"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNBRKRQ8RZRQF64NE13"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNCHEJVPQCTGQPN4EXQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNDBJ396V3AGM0V5CN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNEX5YQN8H7MWPVZRE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNFBG82YNAG07XSF4G3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNGRXDM94M0QMV2NA58"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNHATDZ8EXDCNH8HAHQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNJWAS8TXWETRV7R9ZV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNKACNAQM0BMYB8M199"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNMZ4TRHV64JR6F098K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNNDPRNVA030CX2WAZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNP2F90JYHJPN3XMBQE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNQJAVA3PHJBTFCCJ00"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNR7F9PT2E3BVW9H4YT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNSFD67GSHKKMRSYPSJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNT3ZDWET0WWXAERVZ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNVVETRAB0KR7XFN5V4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNWWDN7G8MRMZNX2CA8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNXCYKQKBCXH2DVKVVY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNY0YZ3QXE23RC8C46V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNZH1TRRP56KQK70MQV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP0N66VMMFJ4JWQDMW4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP1DC60QCBWNCECK43E"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP21376P5V7QN0MJAY8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP360A38STBEPWKC9NB"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP4TSFM2PK42PVYE9NQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP5J96GCCFQ1N2HV6FD"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP65TJ391MD2TDCXD1T"}]},"id":"01M6S74NP7YH9SQ8GMGW0YFP0Q","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-06","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where coherence is produced when no part yields","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NN7SHFYW6AR23W65XAF"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNBRKRQ8RZRQF64NE13"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNFBG82YNAG07XSF4G3"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNMZ4TRHV64JR6F098K"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNWWDN7G8MRMZNX2CA8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP0N66VMMFJ4JWQDMW4"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP4TSFM2PK42PVYE9NQ"}],"prose":"The held space is about many parts that will not give up their own vocabulary, rules or owners, yet must behave as one whole. Everything in it is an answer to where that oneness gets made: in a go-between, in a division of judgment into roles, in a rehearsal, and in a sparse place where the work is tried.","title":"Acting as one without merging"},"id":"01M6S74NN6Z2M6HGRZD1GSHTJA","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what each part keeps for itself","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NN8BTCFGAPXA7HVG684"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NN98C8V9HJDVBY01X0A"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNAYYJFXJKX3QYQHERH"}],"prose":"The ground beneath everything is a decision not to fuse the parts. Sharing a single format or a common layer is turned down because it would cost each part its freedom to change on its own.","title":"The refusal to merge"},"id":"01M6S74NN7SHFYW6AR23W65XAF","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the bound on a part's freedom","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0957APBWA2W6N7RK4HA1J"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"A part is whole in itself and also answers to something larger; its freedom is real but bounded by its place. This double standing is taken as given, and every later design must leave it intact.","title":"Autonomy as a premise"},"id":"01M6S74NN8BTCFGAPXA7HVG684","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is held in common","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S095KGFWMBWNW19K2CKDZC"},{"$ref":"01M6S095NRWBNYWJEQPXGFXTC5"},{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"}],"prose":"Systems can meet by all adopting one form, by mapping through a shared middle model, or by translating pairwise with nothing held in common. The third is chosen, and the obstacles it must cross are sorted by kind and by concern.","title":"Three ways of meeting"},"id":"01M6S74NN98C8V9HJDVBY01X0A","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which layer is allowed to be uniform","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S096H49RY8HY208YF1QTMF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"}],"prose":"Having refused a uniform standard, the text keeps calling for shared protocols, formats and agreed ontological patterns. The thing declined at the level of meaning comes back at the level of wire and governance.","title":"The standard that returns"},"id":"01M6S74NNAYYJFXJKX3QYQHERH","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how long a shared meaning lives","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NNCHEJVPQCTGQPN4EXQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNDBJ396V3AGM0V5CN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNEX5YQN8H7MWPVZRE3"}],"prose":"Instead of a lasting common vocabulary, meaning is negotiated each time two parts meet and dropped when the meeting ends. Agreement becomes an event, not a possession.","title":"Meaning made at the meeting"},"id":"01M6S74NNBRKRQ8RZRQF64NE13","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifetime and scope of a semantic agreement","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"Small ontologies are built for one task or episode, used, then discarded or revised. They let a newcomer be understood at runtime without anyone having agreed in advance.","title":"Temporary contracts of sense"},"id":"01M6S74NNCHEJVPQCTGQPN4EXQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who carries the cost of difference","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S096CKGYTCWVA3S2R2HD5Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"}],"prose":"Someone must render one part's inputs into another's terms, across syntax and meaning alike. That labour is given to a dedicated component, and a language model is named as the likely translator.","title":"Translation as a standing job"},"id":"01M6S74NNDBJ396V3AGM0V5CN6","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the absence of a single authority under sudden load","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094VHECP7DNYBAFKGW3ZP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S0966QJ26TRP3SYCMVVJ1G"},{"$ref":"01M6S09680J8SGQ5QP5F1RE969"},{"$ref":"01M6S096JM086986QX3E3WZWJ1"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"}],"prose":"The pressure for runtime agreement is shown in crowded settings where transport, energy and care belong to different hands and no sovereign exists. An accident or disruption forces them to coordinate at once.","title":"Many owners, one emergency"},"id":"01M6S74NNEX5YQN8H7MWPVZRE3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much authority the mediator holds","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NNGRXDM94M0QMV2NA58"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNHATDZ8EXDCNH8HAHQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNJWAS8TXWETRV7R9ZV"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNKACNAQM0BMYB8M199"}],"prose":"A special holon is placed among the others to bind them, and it gradually becomes the one above them. Its anatomy, its duties and the degree of its power are the substance here.","title":"The go-between that rises"},"id":"01M6S74NNFBG82YNAG07XSF4G3","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which pieces the mediator is made of","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"}],"prose":"The mediator is built from six pieces: a deciding head, a recorder of what exists and how it can connect, a translator, a finder, and a planner and runner of workflows. The record of possible links is what lets new elements be wired in.","title":"Anatomy of the binder"},"id":"01M6S74NNGRXDM94M0QMV2NA58","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the mediator is responsible for","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"}],"prose":"It brokers communication, steers conflicting goals toward convergence, gathers data for those who decide, arbitrates disputes and reshapes roles as conditions change. It works on meaning and organisation, leaving the technical plumbing assumed.","title":"Duties of the binder"},"id":"01M6S74NNHATDZ8EXDCNH8HAHQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the drift from mediation to command","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"}],"prose":"Presented first as a connector that respects autonomy, the mediator becomes the orchestrator, the superholon, and finally the holder of highest authority that can restructure everything below it.","title":"From connector to highest authority"},"id":"01M6S74NNJWAS8TXWETRV7R9ZV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the setting of the autonomy dial","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNY0YZ3QXE23RC8C46V"}],"prose":"How far the mediator and its holons may act is left adjustable: workflow planning can be removed, leaving only control of execution, and holons in simulation range from passive sources to rule-changing actors.","title":"A dial of autonomy"},"id":"01M6S74NNKACNAQM0BMYB8M199","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how far a holon may alter the run","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"}],"prose":"Holons in simulation may only supply data, react, learn across runs, or rewrite the rules and objectives; the ladder is one of increasing reach over the run itself.","title":"Degrees of steering"},"id":"01M6S74NNY0YZ3QXE23RC8C46V","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which faculty is separated out and what it guards","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NNNDPRNVA030CX2WAZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNP2F90JYHJPN3XMBQE"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNQJAVA3PHJBTFCCJ00"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNVVETRAB0KR7XFN5V4"}],"prose":"A single good decision is split into separate faculties, each given its own holon: weighing the long term, grasping context, checking for bias, keeping to norms, and staying aware. The whole then depends on how these roles feed and watch one another.","title":"Judgment divided into roles"},"id":"01M6S74NNMZ4TRHV64JR6F098K","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the deficit each role is meant to fill","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S0919HQTTW5K4S0JD9BAN6"},{"$ref":"01M6S091CAZDYVGXTAQ2RARAAA"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"}],"prose":"Each role answers a named failing of autonomous systems: brittleness when conditions shift, inherited bias, missing accountability, and thin awareness. The hope is that adding data, learning and ethics to a holarchy closes these gaps.","title":"The deficits that call for roles"},"id":"01M6S74NNNDPRNVA030CX2WAZS","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the quality of the shared picture","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0943RC500MSJR3TQ6FQP3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0944TNASX9K8JK5V5RTRP"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"},{"$ref":"01M6S094QH86CGJ2VPFEPRMBRA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"}],"prose":"Before any role can judge, something must turn raw heterogeneous data into situational knowledge and spread a shared picture across levels. Understanding and vigilance are the faculties the others stand on.","title":"Sense and awareness as substrate"},"id":"01M6S74NNP2F90JYHJPN3XMBQE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who evaluates whom","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NNR7F9PT2E3BVW9H4YT"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNSFD67GSHKKMRSYPSJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNT3ZDWET0WWXAERVZ4"}],"prose":"Some roles do not decide but check what others decide; one role watches all layers. The arrangement is a small polity of evaluation feeding a balancer, under a monitor.","title":"Checkers, deciders and an overseer"},"id":"01M6S74NNQJAVA3PHJBTFCCJ00","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the verdict passed upward","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"}],"prose":"Norm-keeping and bias-checking holons pass their verdicts to the holon that trades short-term gain against long-term outcome; inside the mediator they become validation layers and guarded stores.","title":"Checks that feed a decision"},"id":"01M6S74NNR7F9PT2E3BVW9H4YT","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the time horizon of a goal","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093NFQRR88X9PD990GSFB"},{"$ref":"01M6S093PESAZNQ254MP8QMHMG"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"},{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"}],"prose":"The effective role refuses mere speed and asks for long consequences, but how to measure that remains open, with scores, votes or rules offered as candidates.","title":"The weigher of horizons"},"id":"01M6S74NNSFD67GSHKKMRSYPSJ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"alignment of local choice with the whole","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S094RFB8ZYRDV9DDW98ERX"},{"$ref":"01M6S094SYAEG8KEJ8AW61YRGQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"}],"prose":"The vigilant role watches outputs below it and system-wide states, keeping local choices aligned with the whole; it is also what the orchestrators are said to be.","title":"The overseer of all layers"},"id":"01M6S74NNT3ZDWET0WWXAERVZ4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how distinct a role stays when used","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093QQZ23D7GNGKT5YFGTK"},{"$ref":"01M6S093RJMS7XD707H2868RX0"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BKTDMZ0B76G7C8BX946"}],"prose":"The roles are crisp in name but blur in use: the effective role borrows the ethical role's examples word for word, and in the trial a communicating holon is called unbiased and a traveller's holon called understanding. In the end they are named analytical constructs rather than parts to be built.","title":"Porous boundaries between roles"},"id":"01M6S74NNVVETRAB0KR7XFN5V4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the distance between rehearsal and act","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NNXCYKQKBCXH2DVKVVY"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNY0YZ3QXE23RC8C46V"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NNZH1TRRP56KQK70MQV"}],"prose":"Simulation is not only where holons are modelled but where they take the wheel, and the trial system is doubled by a simulated twin that tests and can veto its results.","title":"Rehearsal that steers itself"},"id":"01M6S74NNWWDN7G8MRMZNX2CA8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what holons add over flat agents","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"Agent simulation, assisted simulation and monitored simulation are carried over to holons, with the added layering that lets them coordinate across levels. Emergent social patterns from simple local rules stand behind the move.","title":"From agents to holons in simulation"},"id":"01M6S74NNXCYKQKBCXH2DVKVVY","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"fidelity between the twin and the live system","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"Each live holon has a federate copy, synchronised through a shared runtime and managed by a local stand-in for the mediator. Discrepancies are flagged upward, results invalidated, and outcomes scored on time, emissions and access.","title":"A twin that can veto"},"id":"01M6S74NNZH1TRRP56KQK70MQV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what is missing and how it comes to be seen","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NP1DC60QCBWNCECK43E"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP21376P5V7QN0MJAY8"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP360A38STBEPWKC9NB"}],"prose":"The ideas are tried where people and services are thin on the ground, so that a key object is not a flow to optimise but an absence to locate.","title":"A sparse place as the trial ground"},"id":"01M6S74NP0N66VMMFJ4JWQDMW4","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the detectability of a gap","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5BW0BNN3HVZ12K0BPE"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"}],"prose":"Places with no transport are found from gaps in routes, from monitoring, and from reports of zones people avoid. Noticing the lack becomes a product in its own right, alongside serving trips.","title":"Absence made visible"},"id":"01M6S74NP1DC60QCBWNCECK43E","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the order in which roles touch a request","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099K16DKC7EQQ35ANCYXH"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2VW9MCRGFVA05NDNK8"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3PSM31D58SR50QBDQS"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A3Q6P77FKPS24YHHCNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"A request passes from a traveller's holon through service holons, monitored conditions and a translating communicator, is optimised, validated and returned. Every role of the earlier division is given a station along this path.","title":"The path of a single trip"},"id":"01M6S74NP21376P5V7QN0MJAY8","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the gap between claim and evidence","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09BAGXSGTE19VJ36NDS5M"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BEWR9X5Z7H9RYYS9WNB"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"The trial is said to yield scalability, responsiveness, fairer access and lower emissions, though it is offered as a demonstration rather than a validation.","title":"Goods claimed for the sparse place"},"id":"01M6S74NP360A38STBEPWKC9NB","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"breadth behind and debts ahead","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S74NP5J96GCCFQ1N2HV6FD"},{"$ref":"01M6S74NP65TJ391MD2TDCXD1T"}],"prose":"Around the core stands where the idea came from and what it has not yet faced: a widening from factories to grids and building sites, and unsolved costs of scale, security and proof.","title":"Lineage and open edges"},"id":"01M6S74NP4TSFM2PK42PVYE9NQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
